{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2022-10-24 14:00:00', 'title': 'CAESARS PALACE CELEBRATES THE GRAND OPENING OF DOMINIQUE ANSEL LAS VEGAS', 'text': 'INVENTOR OF THE CRONUT® AND AWARD-WINNING PASTRY CHEF DOMINIQUE ANSEL WELCOMED GUESTS TO HIS NEW BAKERY ON THE LAS VEGAS STRIP **FOR HIGH-RES IMAGES FROM THE OPENING, CLICK HERE**\xa0 **FOR DOMINIQUE ANSEL LAS VEGAS FOOD IMAGES, CLICK HERE**\xa0 **FOR B-ROLL, CLICK HERE** LAS VEGAS , OCT. 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CREATIVE CONFECTIONARIES, DECADENT DESSERTS AND, OF COURSE, THE CRONUT®\xa0HAVE ARRIVED AT DOMINIQUE ANSEL LAS VEGAS AT CAESARS PALACE. JAMES BEARD AWARD-WINNING PASTRY CHEF DOMINIQUE ANSEL HAS OPENED HIS BAKE SHOP AND INTRODUCED HIS ONLY-IN-VEGAS "LUCKY 7" COLLECTION, COOKIE SHOTS, FROZEN S\'MORES, THE CRONUT® FLAVOR OF THE MONTH, AND MORE TO THE RESORT.'}